// "04 - Pocket": a dry, straight-eighth piano groove in E-flat major. A two-bar hook
// drops a fourth, steps up, jumps a fifth, then answers higher. Short offbeat chords fit between
// bass attacks; a quieter bridge borrows A-flat minor before the hook returns. 32 bars.

